>who was douglas adams?
[Out of the story: Douglas Adams (1952-2001) was an English writer and humorist,
born in Cambridge. He created The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy as a BBC
Radio 4 comedy that first aired in March 1978, then turned it into a series of
novels, five of them his own, ending with Mostly Harmless in 1992. He also wrote
the Dirk Gently novels, co-wrote Last Chance to See with the zoologist Mark
Carwardine, worked on Doctor Who as a writer and script editor, and co-wrote
Infocom's 1984 Hitchhiker's text adventure with Steve Meretzky. He died in
California in May 2001, at the age of 49. This game is an unofficial fan tribute
and has no connection with his estate.]

